      <li><strong>Dover-Foxcroft guide:</strong> <a href="/guides/dover-foxcroft-dispensary-guide">Dover-Foxcroft Dispensary Guide</a></li>
      <li><strong>Piscataquis County dispensary directories:</strong> Search Weedmaps, Leafbuyer, or wheresweed.com for "Piscataquis County" or specific Milo / Dover-Foxcroft listings</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Adult-use customers: bring a valid government-issued photo ID showing you are 21 or older. Confirm current hours and menu with the operator before visiting.</p>
  </section>

  
